P\\in M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingName}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingName}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ForcingLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ForcingLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ForcingLanguage}_S(M,\\mathbb P,L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\n\\exists T,a,\\dot\\in\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{\\tau\\in M:\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\{\\dot\\in\\}\\cup T,\\omega)\n\\land a(\\dot\\in)=2\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in T\\;(a(\\tau)=0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Language}_S(L,\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},T,a)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ForcingLanguage}_S(M,\\mathbb P,L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\n\\exists T,a,\\dot\\in\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{\\tau\\in M:\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\{\\dot\\in\\}\\cup T,\\omega)\n\\land a(\\dot\\in)=2\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in T\\;(a(\\tau)=0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Language}_S(L,\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},T,a)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The arity map is defined on both the membership symbol and every name constant: membership has arity two and constants have arity zero, exactly as required by the five-place language source.</li>\n<li>The constants are exactly the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span>-names belonging to the set model <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, so the signature is set-coded. Equality and logical connectives belong to the ambient first-order logic and are not relation symbols of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-name","status":"resolved","id":"358e6a76f575bdbe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-name]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"d81b1b2123168018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\mathbb P,L,T,a,\\dot\\in\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingName}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Language}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ForcingLanguage}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing3\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing3ForcingLanguage}_S(M,\\mathbb P,L)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathbb P\\in M\\land\n\\exists T,a,\\dot\\in\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nT=\\{\\tau\\in M:\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingName}_S(\\tau,\\mathbb P)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,\\{\\dot\\in\\}\\cup T,\\omega)\n\\land a(\\dot\\in)=2\n\\land\\forall\\tau\\in T\\;(a(\\tau)=0)\n\\land\\mathrm{Language}_S(L,\\varnothing,\\{\\dot\\in\\},T,a)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":1598,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2074","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing3-forcing-language.md|58-df-zfc-forcing3-forcing-language]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["358e6a76f575bdbe","7ccfc8c88f29968a","d81b1b2123168018","36d7463d215be751"]}